<title>USA: U.S. Treasury balances at Fed fell on March 10.</title>
<headline>U.S. Treasury balances at Fed fell on March 10.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Treasury balances at Federal Reserve based on Treasury Department's latest budget statement.</p>
<p>			  (BILLIONS OF DLRS)</p>
<p>				March 10		March 7</p>
<p>Fed acct			 4.347		  5.290</p>
<p>Tax/loan note acct	  10.468		  8.333</p>
<p>Cash balance		  14.814		 13.623</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Total public debt,</p>
<p> subject to limit	5,266.933	     5,265.656</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Treasury said individual income tax refunds valued at $1 million were issued and $56 million of corporate refunds were issued.</p>
</text>
